# Repo overlay for the oxfmt `--ignore-path`, concatenated onto the fleet
# canonical `.config/fleet/.prettierignore` by `pickIgnorePath`.

# The patched Node source overlay. Everything here mirrors Node's own tree
# (deps/, doc/, lib/, src/, typings/) and is applied as patches against it, so
# it has to keep upstream's shape rather than the fleet's: reflowing a file
# changes the patch and invites conflicts on the next Node bump.
#
# The typings are load-bearing beyond style — `smol-sql.test.mts` asserts on the
# usage examples inside their doc comments, and reformatting them broke that
# test.
**/additions/source-patched/**
